                  optional
                </span>
              )}
            </p>''')
s=s.replace('''<p className="font-doto mt-2 text-foreground/80">two minutes, one command.</p>''','''<p className="font-doto mt-2 text-foreground/80">first time? follow these in order — steps 1–7 take two minutes.</p>''')
open(p,'w').write(s)
